#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:4
msgid "ToonzScript"
msgstr "ToonzScript"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:5
msgid ""
"ToonzScript is the scripting language used in OpenToonz. Using ToonzScript "
"allows users to create sequences of commands, thus avoiding the need to perform "
"repetitive tasks manually. ToonzScript is based on QtScript and is built on the "
"ECMAScript standard. A reference guide for the ECMAScript standard can be found "
"at the following URL:"
msgstr ""
"ToonzScript是OpenToonz中使用的脚本语言。使用ToonzScript允许用户创建命令序列，从"
"而避免了手动执行重复任务的需要。ToonzScript基于QtScript，并基于ECMAScript标准构"
"建。ECMAScript标准的参考指南可以在以下网址找到："

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:7
msgid "`ECMAScript Reference <http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/ecmascript.html>`_"
msgstr "`ECMAScript参考<http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/ecmascript.html>`_"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:9
msgid ""
"Several well known scripting languages are based on the ECMAScript standard "
"such as JavaScript, JScript, and ActionScript. The ToonzScript syntax is "
"similar to that of JavaScript, for this reason, a good introduction to "
"JavaScript can be very useful to better understand ToonzScript's basics."
msgstr ""
"几种众所周知的脚本语言基于ECMAScript标准，如JavaScript、JScript和ActionScript。"
"ToonzScript语法与JavaScript语法相似，因此，对JavaScript进行一个很好的介绍对于更"
"好地理解ToonzScript的基础知识非常有用。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:11
msgid ""
"The original ToonzScript page with some (rather old) examples is available at "
"the following URL:"
msgstr "原始的ToonzScript页面和一些（相当旧的）示例可以在以下网址上找到："

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:13
msgid "`ToonzScript page <http://www.toonz.com/htm/support/Script.htm>`_"
msgstr "`ToonzScript页面<http://www.toonz.com/htm/support/Script.htm>`_"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:15
msgid ""
"Scripts can be run using the ``File  →  Script  →  Run Script...`` command. "
"Alternatively, commands can be typed and executed directly in the Script "
"Console, which can be opened using the ``File  →  Script  →  Open Script "
"Console...`` command."
msgstr ""
"脚本可以使用``文件运行→  脚本→  运行脚本。..命令。或者，可以直接在脚本控制台中键"
"入和执行命令，该控制台可以使用“文件”打开→  脚本→  打开脚本控制台。..命令。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:17
msgid ""
"When a script is running, the Script Console will open automatically to show "
"the commands contained within the script."
msgstr "当脚本运行时，脚本控制台将自动打开，显示脚本中包含的命令。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:23
msgid "File management"
msgstr "文件管理"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:25
msgid "|toonz_script_runscript|"
msgstr "|toonz_script_runscript|"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:27
msgid ""
"The ToonzScript file extension is .js, scripts need to be in the ``OpenToonz "
"stuff/library/script`` folder, to be automatically retrieved by opening the Run "
"Script command browser."
msgstr ""
"ToonzScript文件扩展名为.js，脚本需要在“OpenToonz stuff/library/script”文件夹中，"
"通过打开Run script命令浏览器自动检索。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:33
msgid "Using the Script Console"
msgstr "使用脚本控制台"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:35
msgid "|toonz_script_console|"
msgstr "|toonz_script_console|"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:37
msgid ""
"The Script Console allows the user to directly enter commands, additionally, "
"dragging & dropping external text files into the console will automatically "
"insert the path of the file(s)."
msgstr ""
"脚本控制台允许用户直接输入命令，此外，将外部文本文件拖放到控制台中会自动插入文件"
"的路径。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:39
msgid ""
"Start a series of lengthy operations from the console does not block the "
"interface."
msgstr "从控制台启动一系列冗长的操作不会阻塞界面。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:45
msgid "Console use conventions"
msgstr "控制台使用约定"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:46
msgid ""
"The following conventions are implemented in the use of the Script Console:"
msgstr "在使用脚本控制台时实现了以下约定："

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:48
msgid "Only the text of the last paragraph can be edited."
msgstr "只能编辑最后一段的文本。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:50
msgid "The Up and Down arrow keys allow the navigation of the command history."
msgstr "向上和向下箭头键允许导航命令历史记录。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:52
msgid ""
"The execution of time consuming commands doesn’t prevent interaction with the "
"software interface."
msgstr "执行耗时的命令并不妨碍与软件界面的交互。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:54
msgid ""
"The **ctrl+y**  shortcut interrupts the execution of time consuming commands."
msgstr "**ctrl+y**快捷键会中断耗时命令的执行。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:56
msgid ""
"When entering a path in a string, any and all backslashes must be doubled. "
"Following this rule the path: ``C:\\tmp\\test.jpg``  becomes ``C:\\\\tmp\\"
"\\test.jpg`` ."
msgstr ""
"在字符串中输入路径时，任何和所有反斜杠都必须加倍。遵循此规则，路径“C:\\tmp"
"\\test.jpg”将变为“C:\\\\tmp\\\\test.jpg”。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:58
msgid ""
"Even if working on a Windows family OS the slash and the backslash can be used "
"in the same way, thus the path ``C:\\tmp\\test.jpg``  is equivalent to the path "
"``C:/tmp/test.jpg`` ."
msgstr ""
"即使在Windows系列操作系统上工作，斜线和反斜线也可以以相同的方式使用，因此路径“C:"
"\\tmp\\test.jpg”等效于路径“C:/tmp/test.jpg”。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:60
msgid ""
"The drag & drop of an external file into the console generates a string "
"containing the file’s path and the backslashes are doubled automatically."
msgstr ""
"将外部文件拖放到控制台中会生成一个包含文件路径的字符串，反斜杠会自动加倍。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:62
msgid ""
"While you can copy multiple lines of text from the console is allowed only one "
"line paste."
msgstr "虽然您可以从控制台复制多行文本，但只允许粘贴一行。"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:68
msgid "ToonzScript specifications"
msgstr "ToonzScript规范"

#: ../../source/toonzscript.rst:69
msgid ""
"Built on the foundaments of ECMAScript, ToonzScript retains a degree of "
"similarity to the JavaScript syntax but, at the same time, implements some "
"functions and several classes specifically built to make easier the interaction "
"with the OpenToonz software architecture. Here follows the list of the "
"ToonzScript specifications:"
msgstr ""
"ToonzScript建立在ECMAScript的基础上，保留了与JavaScript语法的某种程度的相似性，"
"但同时实现了一些专门构建的函数和几个类，以使与OpenToonz软件架构的交互更容易。以"
"下是ToonzScript规范列表："

